{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.CechChernClass","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.CechChernClass","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.PresheafCentralExtensionObstruction","lean:module:Mathlib.Topology.ContinuousMap.Algebra","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Complex.Circle","lean:module:Mathlib.Topology.Instances.Int","lean:module:Mathlib.Topology.Sets.Opens","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Category.Preorder"],"declarations":52,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.exists_nthRoot_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.exists_nthRoot_iff","kind":"theorem","line":604,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L604-L658","doc":"**Kummer criterion.** `γ` has an `n`-th root — a `U(1)`-valued 1-cocycle `η`\nwith `ηⁿ = γ` — **iff** `c₁(γ)` is `n`-divisible modulo integer coboundaries,\n`c₁ = δβ + n·θ` with `β` an integer 1-cochain and `θ` an integer 2-cochain. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.divN","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.divN","kind":"def","line":600,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L600-L602","doc":"Integer division by `n`, as a continuous self-map of the discrete group `ℤ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.liftRootsCochain","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.liftRootsCochain","kind":"def","line":591,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L591-L598","doc":"Lift a `μₙ`-valued 1-cochain to an integer 1-cochain through `κ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.kappa_kappaSection","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.kappa_kappaSection","kind":"theorem","line":588,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L588-L589","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.kappaSection","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.kappaSection","kind":"def","line":584,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L584-L586","doc":"A set-theoretic (hence, `μₙ` being discrete, continuous) section of `κ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.instDiscreteTopologySubtypeCircleMemSubgroupRootsOfUnityCircle","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.instDiscreteTopologySubtypeCircleMemSubgroupRootsOfUnityCircle","kind":"instance","line":582,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L582-L582","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.instFiniteSubtypeCircleMemSubgroupRootsOfUnityCircle","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.instFiniteSubtypeCircleMemSubgroupRootsOfUnityCircle","kind":"instance","line":564,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L564-L580","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.kappa_surjective","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.kappa_surjective","kind":"theorem","line":547,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L547-L562","doc":"Every `n`-th root of unity in `U(1)` is `exp(2πik/n)` for some integer `k`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.exists_nthRoot_of_dvd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.exists_nthRoot_of_dvd","kind":"theorem","line":525,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L525-L544","doc":"**`n`-th roots from divisibility.** If `c₁(γ)` is `n`-divisible modulo\ninteger coboundaries, `c₁ = δβ + n·θ`, then `γ` has an `n`-th root: a\n`U(1)`-valued 1-**cocycle** `η` with `ηⁿ = γ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.roots_pow_eq_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.roots_pow_eq_one","kind":"theorem","line":521,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L521-L523","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.kummer_π_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.kummer_π_apply","kind":"theorem","line":517,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L517-L518","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.kummer_obstruction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.kummer_obstruction","kind":"theorem","line":504,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L504-L514","doc":"**Kummer relation (cochain level).** The `μₙ`-obstruction of `γ` for the local\n`n`-th roots `exp(iξ/n)` is the reduction mod `n` of the Chern cochain:\n`obstrₙ(γ) = κ ∘ c₁(γ)`, with `κ(k) = exp(2πik/n)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.localRoot_lift","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.localRoot_lift","kind":"theorem","line":497,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L497-L502","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.localRoot","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.localRoot","kind":"def","line":492,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L492-L494","doc":"The local `n`-th root `exp(iξ/n)` of a real lift `ξ` of `γ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.kappa_eq_one_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.kappa_eq_one_iff","kind":"theorem","line":469,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L469-L485","doc":"`κ(k) = 1` iff `n ∣ k`: `κ` is reduction mod `n`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.continuous_kappa","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.continuous_kappa","kind":"theorem","line":467,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L467-L467","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.kappa_val","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.kappa_val","kind":"theorem","line":464,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L464-L465","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.kappa","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.kappa","kind":"def","line":456,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L456-L462","doc":"`k ↦ exp(2πik/n)`, the reduction `ℤ → ℤ/n ≅ μₙ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.rootHom_pow","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.rootHom_pow","kind":"theorem","line":452,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L452-L454","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.continuous_rootHom","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.continuous_rootHom","kind":"theorem","line":447,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L447-L448","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.rootHom","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.rootHom","kind":"def","line":441,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L441-L445","doc":"`t ↦ exp(it/n)`, the `n`-th root of `exp(it)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.circle_exp_pow","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.circle_exp_pow","kind":"theorem","line":436,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L436-L439","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.kummerExtension","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.kummerExtension","kind":"def","line":411,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L411-L434","doc":"**The Kummer sequence** `1 → C(-, μₙ) → C(-, U(1)) →ⁿ C(-, U(1))` of presheaves\non the opens of `X`, exact on every open set. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.mem_rootsOfUnityCircle","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.mem_rootsOfUnityCircle","kind":"theorem","line":406,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L406-L407","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.rootsOfUnityCircle","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.rootsOfUnityCircle","kind":"def","line":403,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L403-L404","doc":"The `n`-th roots of unity in `U(1)`, as the kernel of `z ↦ zⁿ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.exists_realCocycle_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.exists_realCocycle_iff","kind":"theorem","line":385,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L385-L392","doc":"**`c₁` is the obstruction to a global real logarithm**: `γ` lifts to a\n1-cocycle of continuous real functions (`exp(iη) = γ`, `η` a cocycle) iff `c₁`\nis the coboundary of an integer 1-cochain. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.chernClass_mul_lift","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.chernClass_mul_lift","kind":"theorem","line":365,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L365-L383","doc":"**Additivity for arbitrary lifts**: for any real lift `ζ` of `γγ'`, the class\n`c₁(γγ')` differs from `c₁(γ) + c₁(γ')` by an integer coboundary. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.chernClass_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.chernClass_mul","kind":"theorem","line":351,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L351-L363","doc":"**Additivity of `c₁`** (written multiplicatively in `C(-, ℤ)`): for the\nproduct lift, `c₁(γγ') = c₁(γ) + c₁(γ')` exactly at cochain level. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.chernClass_pull","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.chernClass_pull","kind":"theorem","line":344,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L344-L349","doc":"`c₁` is natural under refinement of the cover. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.chernClass_lift_change","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.chernClass_lift_change","kind":"theorem","line":332,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L332-L342","doc":"`c₁` does not depend on the real lift, up to the coboundary of an integer\n1-cochain. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.chernClass_cocycle","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.chernClass_cocycle","kind":"theorem","line":325,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L325-L330","doc":"`c₁` is a Čech 2-cocycle. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.chernClass_formula","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.chernClass_formula","kind":"theorem","line":307,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L307-L323","doc":"The defining formula: `2π · c₁ᵢⱼₖ(x) = ξᵢⱼ(x) + ξⱼₖ(x) − ξᵢₖ(x)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.chernClass","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.chernClass","kind":"def","line":295,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L295-L301","doc":"**The Čech first Chern class** (cochain level) of a `U(1)`-valued 1-cocycle\n`γ`, relative to a local real lift `ξ`: the obstruction of `γ` for the\nexponential sequence. Concretely `2π · c₁ᵢⱼₖ = ξᵢⱼ + ξⱼₖ − ξᵢₖ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.IsRealLift","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.IsRealLift","kind":"def","line":285,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L285-L293","doc":"A local **real lift** of a `U(1)`-valued 1-cocycle `γ`: a 1-cochain `ξ` of\ncontinuous real functions on the overlaps with `exp(i ξ) = γ`. Such a lift\nexists when every overlap admits a continuous logarithm (e.g. for a cover by\nopens with simply connected overlaps); that existence statement is **not**\nproved here and is an explicit hypothesis. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.expExtension","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.expExtension","kind":"def","line":220,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L220-L274","doc":"**The exponential sequence** `0 → C(-,ℤ) → C(-,ℝ) → C(-,U(1))` of presheaves on\nthe opens of `X` (written multiplicatively), with `ℤ → ℝ` the map `k ↦ 2πk` and\n`ℝ → U(1)` the map `t ↦ exp(it)`. Exactness is proved on every open set: a\ncontinuous real function with `exp(i f) = 1` is `2π` times a continuous (hence\nlocally constant) integer-valued function. Surjectivity of `C(V,ℝ) → C(V,U(1))`\nis **not** claimed (it fails, e.g., for `V` an annulus). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.continuous_realToCircle","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.continuous_realToCircle","kind":"theorem","line":215,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L215-L216","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.realToCircle_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.realToCircle_apply","kind":"theorem","line":212,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L212-L213","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.realToCircle","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.realToCircle","kind":"def","line":206,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L206-L210","doc":"`t ↦ exp(it)`, written multiplicatively. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.continuous_intToReal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.continuous_intToReal","kind":"theorem","line":204,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L204-L204","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.toAdd_intToReal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.toAdd_intToReal","kind":"theorem","line":201,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L201-L202","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.intToReal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.intToReal","kind":"def","line":197,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L197-L199","doc":"`k ↦ 2πk`, written multiplicatively. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.contPresheaf_comm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.contPresheaf_comm","kind":"theorem","line":186,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L186-L189","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.postcomp_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.postcomp_apply","kind":"theorem","line":181,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L181-L184","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.sec","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.sec","kind":"def","line":177,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L177-L179","doc":"A section of `contPresheaf X G` over `V`, viewed as a continuous map. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.postcomp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.postcomp","kind":"def","line":168,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L168-L173","doc":"Postcomposition with a continuous homomorphism, as a morphism of presheaves. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.contPresheaf","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.contPresheaf","kind":"def","line":158,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L158-L166","doc":"The presheaf of groups `V ↦ C(V, G)` on the opens of `X`, for a topological\ngroup `G`; restriction is precomposition with the inclusion. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.PresheafCentralExtension.obstruction_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.PresheafCentralExtension.obstruction_mul","kind":"theorem","line":127,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L127-L147","doc":"**Multiplicativity.** When the middle and quotient presheaves have\ncommutative section groups, the obstruction of a product of cocycles, for the\nproduct of the local lifts, is the product of the obstructions — exactly, at\ncochain level. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.PresheafCentralExtension.obstruction_map","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.PresheafCentralExtension.obstruction_map","kind":"theorem","line":110,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L110-L125","doc":"**Naturality in the extension.** A morphism of central extensions whose\nkernel part `α` and middle part `ε` commute with the inclusions carries the\nobstruction of `ξ` to the obstruction of `ε ∘ ξ` (for any cocycle `γ'` that\n`ε ∘ ξ` lifts). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.PresheafCentralExtension.ι_obstruction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.PresheafCentralExtension.ι_obstruction","kind":"theorem","line":105,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L105-L108","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.mulOneCocycle","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.mulOneCocycle","kind":"def","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L87-L96","doc":"Product of two 1-cocycles with values in a presheaf of commutative groups. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.mapOneCochain","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.mapOneCochain","kind":"def","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L80-L85","doc":"Push a 1-cochain forward along a morphism of presheaves of groups. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.core_mul_defect","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.core_mul_defect","kind":"theorem","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechChernClass.lean#L74-L76","signatureChunk":0}]}